{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-47",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "fig-47: inspect the original function's increasing/decreasing behavior in its original grid and extent. Source facts are confined to source.inventory and source-inventory.json. Authored additions: Semantic ink/grid/paper roles replace scan texture, preserving mathematical solid/dashed distinctions. Margins, horizontal Arial labels, explicit source-coordinate label placement, and readable fixed-640 composition are authored layout choices. Subpixel point objects only bind assertions to the curve. No visible named points, endpoint circles, coordinate labels, or answer annotations are added. No Cyrillic/Chinese caption, equation beyond the original, explanatory text, or new numeric tick is visible. Piecewise cubic interpolation and tangent estimates are authored regularization, not exact source-pixel givens; domain, exact anchors and extrema are unchanged.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/figures/fig-47.png",
      "sha256": "72165e8a75007707922d08a40e395fcee748fef3b5050ed747f7de772e639917"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s1-n34",
        "text": "在图47里画出了一个函数 $f$ 的图象，它的定义域是闭区间 $[-3,7]$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s1-n34",
        "text": "利用这个图象，很容易考察气温随着时间变化的情况."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s1-n34",
        "text": "我们看到，在 $[0,6[$ 区间里，气温下降：曲线上横坐标较大的点，纵坐标反而较小（曲线向下降）. 在 $]6,16[$ 区间里，气温上升：曲线上横坐标较大的点，纵坐标也较大（曲线向上升）. 在 $]16,24]$ 区间里，温度重新下降. 当 $x$ 的值等于 $6$ 时，气温由下降变为上升. 当 $x$ 的值等于 $16$ 时，气温由上升变为下降. 因此，在 $6$ 点和 $16$ 点时，函数变化的性质发生了改变."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s1-n34",
        "text": "我们来看另一个例子."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s1-n34",
        "text": "我们约定，一个变量的值构成函数的定义域时，这个变量叫做函数的自变量."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s1-n34",
        "text": "在这个例子里，自变量是 $x$，它的取值区间是 $[-3,7]$."
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-grid-inventory",
        "description": "12 columns and 12 rows; 13 vertical / 13 horizontal lines; bounds [-4,7,8,-5], steps 1/1, zero offsets. Uniform one-unit square cells; no omitted row or column.",
        "objects": [
          "source-grid"
        ],
        "assertions": [
          "source-grid-dimensions"
        ],
        "requires": [
          "gridDimensions"
        ]
      },
      {
